; Scheme D: channels along X. Eleven 0.40 x 1.00 mm slits per die, one 4 mm plenum.
; Plenum is fed at mid-column y=24-26 mm. Each die has a 4 mm collector past both X ends. Outlets are the outer faces of those collectors.
; PG25 at 40 C stored in the water-liquid slot: rho 1022.5, cp 3900, k 0.476, mu 1.58e-3.
; Four inlet patches share zone inlet. 0.15 L/min each, 0.60 L/min total = 1.0225e-2 kg/s.
; q'' = 205000 W/m2. Native GPU rejects prevent-reverse-flow, so that option is off. One process. No exit.
